  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d34d9af03bd8a374c810bbfad858edf1, type: 3}
  m_Name: Info_Exhibit_02
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Museum.Runtime::Museum.ExhibitInfo
  title: "Vua Ch\u0103m \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c th\u1EA7n h\xF3a"
  period: "Cu\u1ED1i th\u1EBF k\u1EF7 X"
  material: "Sa th\u1EA1ch"
  origin: "V\u01B0\u01A1ng qu\u1ED1c Ch\u0103m Pa (mi\u1EC1n Trung Vi\u1EC7t Nam)"
  source: "Cham Deified King, late 10th C CE \u2014 B\u1EA3o t\xE0ng Ngh\u1EC7 thu\u1EADt
    Minneapolis (Mia) (Sketchfab), gi\u1EA5y ph\xE9p CC0. B\u1EA3n qu\xE9t 3D b\u1EB1ng
    ph\u01B0\u01A1ng ph\xE1p ch\u1EE5p \u1EA3nh (photogrammetry). Hi\u1EC7n v\u1EADt
    th\u1EADt cao 104 cm."
  summary: "T\u01B0\u1EE3ng sa th\u1EA1ch, c\xF3 l\u1EBD l\xE0 m\u1ED9t v\u1ECB vua
    Ch\u0103m \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c th\u1EA7n h\xF3a, cu\u1ED1i th\u1EBF k\u1EF7 X.
    Nh\xE0 vua ng\u1ED3i trong t\u01B0 th\u1EBF thi\u1EC1n, hai tay c\u1EA7m hoa
    sen."
  story: "T\u01B0\u1EE3ng c\xF3 ngu\u1ED3n g\u1ED1c t\u1EEB v\u01B0\u01A1ng qu\u1ED1c
    Ch\u0103m Pa, \u1EDF mi\u1EC1n Trung Vi\u1EC7t Nam ng\xE0y nay. Phong c\xE1ch
    c\u1EE7a t\u01B0\u1EE3ng g\u1EA7n v\u1EDBi \u0111i\xEAu kh\u1EAFc \u1EDF c\xE1c
    khu \u0111\u1EC1n th\xE1p M\u1EF9 S\u01A1n v\xE0 \u0110\u1ED3ng D\u01B0\u01A1ng.\n\nC\xE1c
    vua Ch\u0103m theo quan ni\u1EC7m vua l\xE0 th\u1EA7n. Ch\xE2n dung c\xE1ch \u0111i\u1EC7u
    c\u1EE7a nh\xE0 vua \u0111\xF4i khi \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1EB7t trong c\xE1c
    \u0111\u1EC1n th\u1EDD \u1EA4n \u0110\u1ED9 gi\xE1o v\xE0 Ph\u1EADt gi\xE1o do
    tri\u1EC1u \u0111\xECnh b\u1EA3o tr\u1EE3. T\u01B0\u1EE3ng n\xE0y c\xF3 th\u1EC3
    t\u1EEBng thu\u1ED9c m\u1ED9t ng\xF4i \u0111\u1EC1n nh\u01B0 v\u1EADy.\n\nNh\xE0
    vua ng\u1ED3i trong t\u01B0 th\u1EBF thi\u1EC1n, hai tay dang ra c\u1EA7m hoa
    sen, th\u1EC3 hi\u1EC7n s\u1EF1 thanh khi\u1EBFt. Chu\u1ED7i h\u1EA1t tr\xEAn
    c\u1ED5 gi\u1ED1ng h\u1EA1t rudraksha, lo\u1EA1i h\u1EA1t g\u1EAFn v\u1EDBi th\u1EA7n
    Shiva, v\u1ECB th\u1EA7n m\xE0 c\xE1c vua Ch\u0103m t\xF4n th\u1EDD. M\xE1i t\xF3c
    t\u1EBFt c\u1EA7u k\u1EF3 c\u0169ng g\u1EE3i \u0111\u1EBFn v\u1ECB th\u1EA7n
    n\xE0y.\n\nHi\u1EC7n v\u1EADt th\u1EADt cao 104 cm, thu\u1ED9c b\u1ED9 s\u01B0u
    t\u1EADp c\u1EE7a B\u1EA3o t\xE0ng Ngh\u1EC7 thu\u1EADt Minneapolis (Hoa K\u1EF3)."
